    "created_at": "2023-04-12T08:26:13Z",
    "updated_at": "2023-04-12T08:26:13Z",
    "body": "Well, it's weird for sure. I assumed it was a crude way of replacing in history the load for the form document itself with the result of the form submission, so that navigating in history just shows the result of the form submission and doesn't show the form or resubmits it. With a different target I'm not sure what the intention would be.",
